---
description: TILA error envelope and typed exceptions
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `docs/architecture/errors.md`.

- Raise domain exceptions from `app/core/exceptions.py` (or add there).
- Map to `{ success: false, error: { code, message } }` in error middleware.
- Codes are `SCREAMING_SNAKE`. Do not leak stack traces or secrets to clients.
- Frontend surfaces `error.code` / `error.message` via the error interceptor / feature services.
